# Preregistered 9.6M continuity/cadence screen. This inherits the historical
# Q2 sampler, losses, optimizer, H250 detach cadence, and common initialization.
# Only reset scheduling and the explicitly configured optimizer/CVaR cadence vary.
# Arm D additionally decouples independent CVaR blocks from optimizer commits.
@configs/time_horizon_q2_common.args
--physical-step-budget 9600000
--checkpoint-physical-steps 9600000
--post-update-check finite
--save-every 0
